{"app_label": "project", "model": "series"}}, {"model": "contenttypes.contenttype", "pk": 9, "fields": {"app_label": "project", "model": "movie"}}, {"model": "sessions.session", "pk": "j1ikp93alo9rc94f1lx5z1nikg3gcxzy", "fields": {"session_data": ".eJxVjEEOwiAQRe_C2hCGMhRcuvcMZBioVA0kpV0Z765NutDtf-_9lwi0rSVsPS9hTuIsQJx-t0j8yHUH6U711iS3ui5zlLsiD9rltaX8vBzu30GhXr61sX5U7K13zmTwQ0I1eKsiZgtOa7IwYEzMRvE0RXLeZELGEaJOgODE-wO0xjcb:1vYV2m:Jsd89Mn4Xbu_M1qqZkD4zfQ5uVZPfcsu3nmz2tiCrQA", "expire_date": "2026-01-07T20:01:12.729Z"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Action"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Horror"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "Adventure"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 4, "fields": {"name": "Dark Fantasy"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 5, "fields": {"name": "Martial Arts"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 6, "fields": {"name": "Supernatural"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 7, "fields": {"name": "Comedy"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 8, "fields": {"name": "Fantasy"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 9, "fields": {"name": "Drama"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 10, "fields": {"name": "Sports"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 11, "fields": {"name": "Award Winning"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 12, "fields": {"name": "Sci-Fi"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 13, "fields": {"name": "Avant Garde"}}, {"model": "project.genre", "pk": 14, "fields": {"name": "Romance"}}, {"model": "project.series", "pk": 26, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-27", "updated_at": "2025-12-27", "deleted_at": null, "name": "Dragon Ball Z", "about": "Five years after winning the World Martial Arts tournament, Gokuu is now living a peaceful life with his wife and son. This changes, however, with the arrival of a mysterious enemy named Raditz who presents himself as Gokuu's long-lost brother. He reveals that Gokuu is a descendant of the once powerful but now virtually extinct Saiyan race, whose homeworld was annihilated. When he was sent to Earth as a baby, Gokuu's sole purpose was to conquer and destroy the planet; but after suffering amnesia from a head injury, his violent and savage nature changed, and instead was raised as a kind and well-mannered boy, now fighting to protect others.\n\nWith his failed attempt at forcibly recruiting Gokuu as an ally, Raditz warns Gokuu's friends of a new threat that's rapidly approaching Earth�one that could plunge Earth into an intergalactic conflict and cause the heavens themselves to shake. A war will soon be fought over the seven mystical Dragon Balls, magic objects that can grant any wish. Only the strongest will survive.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "release_year": 1989, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/142022l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0214341/", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/dragon_ball_z", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Z", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12971/watch?locale=US", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8]}}, {"model": "project.series", "pk": 27, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "name": "Chainsaw Man", "about": "Denji is robbed of a normal teenage life, left with nothing but his deadbeat father's overwhelming debt. His only companion is his pet, the chainsaw devil Pochita, with whom he slays devils for money that inevitably ends up in the yakuza's pockets. All Denji can do is dream of a good, simple life: one with delicious food and a beautiful girlfriend by his side. But an act of greedy betrayal by the yakuza leads to Denji's brutal, untimely death, crushing all hope of him ever achieving happiness.\n\nRemarkably, an old contract allows Pochita to merge with the deceased Denji and bestow devil powers on him, changing him into a hybrid able to transform his body parts into chainsaws. Because Denji's new abilities pose a significant risk to society, the Public Safety Bureau's elite devil hunter Makima takes him in, letting him live as long as he obeys her command. Guided by the promise of a content life alongside an attractive woman, Denji devotes everything and fights with all his might to make his naive dreams a reality.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "release_year": 2022, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1806/126216l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt13616990/", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/chainsaw_man", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Chainsaw+Man", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/114410/watch?locale=US", "genre": [1, 8]}}, {"model": "project.series", "pk": 28, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "name": "Dragon Ball Super", "about": "Seven years after the defeat of Majin Buu, Earth is at peace, and its people live free from any dangers lurking in the universe. However, this peace is short-lived; a sleeping threat awakens in the dark reaches of the galaxy: Beerus, the ruthless God of Destruction.\n\nDisturbed by a prophecy that he will be defeated by a \"Super Saiyan God,\" Beerus and his angelic attendant Whis search the universe for this mysterious being. Before long, they reach Earth and encounter Gokuu Son, one of the planet's mightiest warriors, and his powerful friends.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "release_year": 2015, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/7/74606l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt4644488/", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/dragon_ball_super", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Super", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62715/watch?locale=US", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8]}}, {"model": "project.series", "pk": 29, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "name": "Demon Slayer", "about": "Ever since the death of his father, the burden of supporting the family has fallen upon Tanjirou Kamado's shoulders. Though living impoverished on a remote mountain, the Kamado family are able to enjoy a relatively peaceful and happy life. One day, Tanjirou decides to go down to the local village to make a little money selling charcoal. On his way back, night falls, forcing Tanjirou to take shelter in the house of a strange man, who warns him of the existence of flesh-eating demons that lurk in the woods at night.\n\nWhen he finally arrives back home the next day, he is met with a horrifying sight�his whole family has been slaughtered. Worse still, the sole survivor is his sister Nezuko, who has been turned into a bloodthirsty demon. Consumed by rage and hatred, Tanjirou swears to avenge his family and stay by his only remaining sibling. Alongside the mysterious group calling themselves the Demon Slayer Corps, Tanjirou will do whatever it takes to slay the demons and protect the remnants of his beloved sister's humanity.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "release_year": 2019, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1286/99889l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0315465/", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/demon_slayer", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Demon+Slayer", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/85937/watch?locale=US", "genre": [1, 6, 11]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 20, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-27", "updated_at": "2025-12-27", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Dragon Ball Z: Fusion Reborn", "about": "After a janitorial mishap, an unsuspecting custodian transforms into Janemba, a fat, yellow demon who wreaks havoc throughout the afterlife. Gokuu Son has been competing in martial arts tournaments for the undead since his heroic death in the battle against Cell. Soon, Janemba's chaos draws Gokuu and fellow combatant Pikkon toward him, forcing the pair to figure out a way to defeat the giant monster.\r\n\r\nAfter a bout with him, Gokuu witnesses Janemba undergo another transformation: the demon sheds his fat and changes color, turning into a sword-wielding enemy more powerful than anyone Gokuu has faced thus far. With the aid of his similarly deceased rival Vegeta, Gokuu must stop the terrifying Janemba from disrupting the very fabric of the universe.\r\n\r\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "series": 26, "release_year": 1995, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1015/93675l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0142236/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/39107/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/dragon_ball_z_fusion_reborn", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Z:+Fusion+Reborn", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8, 12]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 21, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Chainsaw Man: REZE ARC", "about": "Sequel to Chainsaw Man.", "series": 27, "release_year": 2025, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1763/150638l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt30472557/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1218925/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/chainsaw_man_reze_arc", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Chainsaw+Man:+REZE+ARC", "genre": [1, 8]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 22, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Dragon Ball Super Broly", "about": "Forty-one years ago on Planet Vegeta, home of the infamous Saiyan warrior race, King Vegeta noticed a baby named Broly whose latent power exceeded that of his own son. Believing that Broly's power would one day surpass that of his child, Vegeta, the king sends Broly to the desolate planet Vampa. Broly's father Paragus follows after him, intent on rescuing his son. However, his ship gets damaged, causing the two to spend years trapped on the barren world, unaware of the salvation that would one day come from an unlikely ally.\n\nYears later on Earth, Gokuu Son and Prince Vegeta�believed to be the last survivors of the Saiyan race�are busy training on a remote island. But their sparring is interrupted when the appearance of their old enemy Frieza drives them to search for the last of the wish-granting Dragon Balls on a frozen continent. Once there, Frieza shows off his new allies: Paragus and the now extremely powerful Broly. A legendary battle that shakes the foundation of the world ensues as Gokuu and Vegeta face off against Broly, a warrior without equal whose rage is just waiting to be unleashed.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "series": null, "release_year": 2018, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1575/93498l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt7961060/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/34433/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/dragon_ball_super_broly", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Super+Broly", "genre": [1, 3, 8]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 23, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Dragon Ball Z: Wrath Of The Dragon", "about": "The Z Warriors discover an unopenable music box and are told to open it with the dragon balls. The contents turn out to be a warrior named Tapion who had sealed himself inside along with a monster called Hildegarn. Goku must now perfect a new technique to defeat the evil monster. \n\n(Source: ANN)", "series": null, "release_year": 1995, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1704/93676l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0142243/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/39108/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/dragon_ball_z_wrath_of_the_dragon", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Z:+Wrath+Of+The+Dragon", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8, 12]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 25, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Dragon Ball Z: Broly � The Legendary Super Saiyan", "about": "As Goku investigates the destruction of the Southern Galaxy, Vegeta is taken to be King of the New Planet Vegeta, and to destroy the Legendary Super Saiyan, Broly.\n\n(Source: ANN)", "series": null, "release_year": 1993, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/121524l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0142242/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/34433/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/dragon_ball_z_broly_�_the_legendary_super_saiyan", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Z:+Broly+�+The+Legendary+Super+Saiyan", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8, 12]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 28, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Dragon Ball Z: Broly � Second Coming", "about": "As Goku investigates the destruction of the Southern Galaxy, Vegeta is taken to be King of the New Planet Vegeta, and to destroy the Legendary Super Saiyan, Broly.\n\n(Source: ANN)", "series": 26, "release_year": 1993, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/121524l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0142239/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/44251/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/dragon_ball_z_broly_�_second_coming", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Dragon+Ball+Z:+Broly+�+Second+Coming", "genre": [1, 3, 7, 8, 12]}}, {"model": "project.movie", "pk": 31, "fields": {"created_at": "2025-12-28", "updated_at": "2025-12-28", "deleted_at": null, "movie_name": "Demon Slayer: The Movie: Mugen Train", "about": "After a string of mysterious disappearances begin to plague a train, the Demon Slayer Corps' multiple attempts to remedy the problem prove fruitless. To prevent further casualties, the Flame Pillar, Kyoujurou Rengoku, takes it upon himself to eliminate the threat. Accompanying him are some of the Corps' most promising new blood: Tanjirou Kamado, Zenitsu Agatsuma, and Inosuke Hashibira, who all hope to witness the fiery feats of this model demon slayer firsthand.\r\n\r\nUnbeknownst to them, the demonic forces responsible for the disappearances have already put their sinister plan in motion. Under this demonic presence, the group must muster every ounce of their willpower and draw their swords to save all two hundred passengers onboard. As things begin to spiral out of control, Tanjirou's resolve and commitment to duty are put to the test.\r\n\r\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]", "series": 29, "release_year": 2020, "poster": "https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1704/106947l.jpg", "imdb_link": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt11032374/", "tmdb": "https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/635302/watch?locale=US", "rt_link": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/demon_slayer_the_movie_mugen_train", "crunchyroll": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/search?q=Demon+Slayer:+The+Movie:+Mugen+Train", "genre": [1, 6]}}]
